=== encoder input pipe ===
PIPE VERDICT: TOO SMALL — this arm is NOT fit to measure.
The encoder input pipe is below the 64 KiB minimum xrdp
requires, so it cannot hold enough for xrdp and the encoder
to run at the same time: they take turns, and each turn
costs a pair of context switches. On this fleet that alone
was 5.84 ms per 13.8 MB picture in the standalone pipe
reproducer. It depresses every rate by an amount that has
nothing to do with what is under test.

OWNER ACTION REQUIRED: raise fs/pipe-user-pages-soft on the
HOST, or give the server CAP_SYS_RESOURCE in the initial
user namespace, then re-certify. xrdp will not change a
system setting itself (owner directive, 2026-08-09).

